# Judge3-13-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私は午前１時、<br>ナノカさんと<br>一緒にいました。<br>これはナノカさんが<br>証明してくれますよね？|#0103Trial13_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……あなたが<br>私に<br>襲いかかってきた<br>だけよ。|#0103Trial13_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Flushed_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Flushed_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そうとも<br>言いますね！|#0103Trial13_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でもその時、<br>私は撃たれたんですよ。|#0103Trial13_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:銃弾を、<br>足に一発。|#0103Trial13_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それは……！<br>たしかにそうです……！|#0103Trial13_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:今朝、<br>シェリーさんは医務室に<br>いらっしゃいました……！|#0103Trial13_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:足に大きな怪我を<br>していて……！<br>血も止まらない<br>ですし……！|#0103Trial13_Meruru003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:自己流で<br>止血しようと<br>したんですけど、<br>ダメだったみたいで！|#0103Trial13_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yum_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:今も、<br>立っていることすら<br>辛いんですよ☆|#0103Trial13_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:本当～？<br>嘘<br>言ってんじゃないの？|#0103Trial13_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:傷の深さはメルルさんに<br>聞いてくださーい。|#0103Trial13_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"たしかに……その足では<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_01\">無理</link>だと思います。<br>多少歩くならまだしも、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_02\">重いもの</link>を動かす<br>なんて、とても……。<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_03\">怪我のある体</link>で、<br>できるわけはないと<br>思います……。|#0103Trial13_Meruru004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"つまり私は<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_04\">午前１時以後</link>、<br>重労働はできないんです。<br>それどころか<br>生死の境を<br>彷徨っていたと<br>言いますか……。|#0103Trial13_Sherry008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Flushed_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ですがアリサさんの聞いた<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_05\">大きな音</link>は<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_06\">【午前２時】</link>……。<br>私が足の怪我で<br>苦しんでいた時間です。<br>私では、建物を<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_07\">動かす</link>犯行は<br>できないんですよ～。|#0103Trial13_Sherry009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆達観したように穏やかな笑み。最後の「言いますか？」はシリアスさで大人っぽく。
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR12,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
; @gosubModifyCamera 0 look:Sherry comp:Right rollDir:Left zoomLvl:4
@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Height:6 Rotation:"0,{ (1.95 / courtStandCount * 360)},-4" Distance:14 Duration:3.2 EaseName:OutQuad
@PrintDebateText Text:それでも<br>私が犯人だって……<br>言いますか？|#0103Trial13_Sherry010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:4

