# Judge3-13-3

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:シェリーちゃんなら、<br>痛みを我慢できたんじゃないかな……！|#0103Trial13_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:まあ、我慢強いほうだとは思いますが……<br>体の機能的に、建物は持ち上げられませんよ！<br>だって、踏ん張れませんから！|#0103Trial13_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:それはメルルさんが証明してくれるはずです！<br>……ですよねっ、メルルさん！|#0103Trial13_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:そ、そうですね……<br>かなり深い傷でしたし、シェリーさんの言う通り、<br>体を支えきれないと思います……。|#0103Trial13_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes2_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:むしろ立つことだけでも精一杯で、<br>どうしてすぐに来てくれなかったのか……。|#0103Trial13_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Flushed_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:まだ寝ている時間に起こすわけにもいきませんよ！<br>自分で処置してみたんですが、<br>あんまり上手くいかなくて～。|#0103Trial13_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:で、でもシェリーちゃんの魔法なら<br>体自体が強化されてたのかもしれないし！<br>演技で乗り切れた可能性も……！|#0103Trial13_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……歩こうとするだけで出血する状態だったので、<br>やはり難しかったとは思います……。<br>あと少し治療が遅れたら手遅れだった可能性も……。|#0103Trial13_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:エマさんがメルルさんの言葉を疑うというなら……<br>私が耐えられたということを<br>証明してみてください！|#0103Trial13_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（う……！<br>　そんなのできるのかな……）|#0103Trial13_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
